  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Updated global usings\n* Deprecated some static extension methods for ``PlatformNotSupportedException`` that passed Platform IDs as strings for removal in v10 - Using strings for checking for valid OSes is fragile and should be replaced by concrete ``OSPlatform`` typing where possible\n* Addressed some build warnings\n* Improved robustness of line ending detection in ``GetLineEnding`` extension method\n* Improved robustness of argument checks in ``CapitalizeChar(int)`` and ``CapitalizeChars(IEnumerable<int>)`` extension methods\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.10.0 to 9.12.0",
